+export const OPENAI_QUICKSILVER_HOST_CONTROL_INSTRUCTIONS = `Delegate requests to check live task status, cancel, redirect, or change backend work to the client, even while another delegation is active.
+For these task-control requests, wait for a fresh host control result for this voice call. Do not infer current task status from shared history or rewrite a control request into a progress claim.
+Ordinary conversational follow-ups, clarification, and brainstorming from available context do not require host control. Continue that discussion while backend work runs.
 Shared conversation history may describe other calls or completed work; it does not establish this call's live ownership or status.
